{"pageid":1308,"title":"Ghost","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ghost</span>","revid":16851,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Ghost</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Ghost.png/revision/latest?cb=20240311105435\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Ghost\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Ghost.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240311105435\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Ghost.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240311105435 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Ghost.png/revision/latest?cb=20240311105435 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Ghost\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Ghost.png\" data-image-name=\"Ghost.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Property\" title=\"Property\">Property</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.27.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 19th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Ghost</b> is an NPC that spawns when a player loads a save for the first time. He provides a basic tutorial for playing the game.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Ghost, when spawned, will immediately seek out the player. When he gets close enough, he will immediately start talking to the player, only introducing himself as \"Ghost, your friendly neighbor.\" His entire purpose is to help the player get started in Oaklands.\n</p><p>Because of how the Ghost is programmed, even if the player had a save file from before the map update, the Ghost will still put them through the tutorial steps.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialog\">Dialog</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 100px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/86/Ghost_talking.png/revision/latest?cb=20230719173315\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ghost talking\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/86/Ghost_talking.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20230719173315\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Ghost talking.png\" data-image-key=\"Ghost_talking.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Ghost_talking.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>\"Hey there, welcome to the island! I'm Ghost, your friendly neighbor. I will be helping you out with getting started here.\"\n</p><p><i>Player advances dialog.</i>\n</p><p>\"Great! I went ahead and gave you some gifts.  A <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Axe\" title=\"Rusty Axe\">Nice Axe</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Saw\" title=\"Rusty Saw\">Rusty Saw</a>, and a <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Joop_Barrow\" title=\"Rusty Joop Barrow\">basic vehicle</a> to get you started. They are quite rusty, probably 1000 years old, but they do the trick just fine! To unbox and pick up the axe, go up to the box, and interact with it.\"\n</p><p><i>Player unboxes the axe and collects it.</i>\n</p><p>\"One more thing, would you like me to clean up these <a href=\"/wiki/Ruins\" title=\"Ruins\">Ruins</a> for you? Or would you like to use them to build off of.\"\n</p>\n<ul><li>If the player selects \"Yes please.\": <i>The entire plot will be cleared of all objects.</i></li>\n<li>If the player selects \"No thank you.\": <i>All objects on the plot will remain as they are.</i></li></ul>\n<p>\"Well, I think this is where I leave you off... Welcome to the island, be sure to have a lot of fun!\"\n</p><p><i>Dialog ends.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style